<title>UK: ADB SETS $300 MILLION 30-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>ADB SETS $300 MILLION 30-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley Dean Witter.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASIAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.22	MATURITY   *15.AUG.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    15.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  4.5	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *PUT OPTION 15.AUG.07, 15.AUG.12, 15.AUG.17 AND</p>
<p>		15.AUG.22</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT	  0.75	UNDERWRIT  0.75	SELL CONC   3.0</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
